   "html": "<table><tr><td>No.</td><td>Scripts</td><td>Explanation</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>TAKE MODEL. lng SET GLOBAL 0 SET MULTIS 0 GO QUIT</td><td>Selects the General Solver to solve the model stored in MODEL.lng</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>TAKE MODEL. lng SET GLOBAL 1 SET MULTIS 0 SET MTMODE 1 SET NTHRDS NT SET TIMLIM 3600 GO QUIT</td><td>Selects the Global Solver (the multi-thread mode is used, and the number of threads is NT) to solve the model stored in MODEL.lng and terminates the process after 3600 s</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>TAKE MODEL. lng SET GLOBAL 0 SET MULTIS NS SET MTMODE 1 SET NTHRDS NT GO QUIT</td><td>Selects the Multi-start Solver (the number of starting points is NS; the multi-thread mode is used, and the number of threads is NT) to solve the model stored in MODEL.lng</td></tr></table>"
